<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS - RF Micro sees solid gains.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS - RF Micro sees solid gains.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of RF Micro Devices Inc, a manufacturer of radio frequency integrated circuits for wireless communications, gained over 33 percent in midday trading, rising to 16 from their IPO price of $12.</p>
<p>The deal, lead managed by Montgomery Securities, priced above the anticipated range of $9 to $11 a share.  The number of shares on offer was also increased to around 3.04 million from the 2.5 million stipulated in the filing.</p>
</text>
